        "evidence_id": "E001",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, the plaintiff appeals from an order of the Supreme Court, Richmond County (Judith N. McMahon, J.), dated July 23, 2020. The order granted the defendants' motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint.",
