        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, the defendant appeals from an order of the Supreme Court, Nassau County (Iannacci, J.), entered November 9, 2009, which denied its motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint.",
