      {
        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "On June 8, 2007, a clear, sunny day, the plaintiff was exiting the defendant’s premises when she allegedly tripped and fell. The plaintiff attributed her fall to a crack on a concrete platform step.",
